    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37608" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξορμ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring out of harbour,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ναῦν ἐξορμίσαι ἐκ τοῦ λιμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					33.9
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>put out to sea,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sophr.
				52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.670
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>let down,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς πόντον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1247
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				Pass.
			 in med. sense, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξώρμισαι σὸν
				πόσα</span> thou <i>hast come forth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				846
			</span></i>.</div>
